File Index

/AreaHeaderEditor.tsx
Purpose: #AREA header form (name/credits/vnum range) with an inline warning when the range no longer covers a defined vnum; the server enforces the same shrink guard plus overlap-vs-area.lst on save.

/areas.css
Purpose: All builder styling — sidebar/toolbar/toast, compact form system (mb-field label-above inputs, mb-fieldset groups, mb-form-grid, mb-dice-row, mb-flag-grid, mb-form width cap), preview/diff colors, world dashboard table, Phase 10 import panel + audit table, Phase 11 presence badge/banner, conflict panel, ref-link buttons (incl. Phase 13's mb-room-spawn-link), Phase 13 Simulate pane (mb-spawn-room accordion, mb-spawn-list/gear/contents nesting, mb-spawn-warnings).

/AreasPage.test.tsx
Purpose: Phase 11 tests: conditional save sends/refreshes baseHash, 409 → conflict panel (save-anyway resends WITHOUT hash; reload refetches and clears), presence badge + banner rendering from mocked /api/presence.

/AreasPage.tsx
Purpose: Areas tab — area list (with presence badges), area header fieldset (AreaHeaderEditor), room picker, RoomEditor, preview/diff (external-ref links navigate via navigateToRef), manual raw-text edit path (flagged MANUAL EDITS), the Phase 10 "Import .are file…" toggle, and Phase 11 conditional saves (baseHash state, 409 conflict panel, reload/save-anyway) + initialTarget cross-page navigation from the World tab; threads an optional onOpenSpawn prop straight through to RoomEditor (Phase 13).

/ImportAreaPanel.test.tsx
Purpose: Import panel tests: clean validate→commit (overwrite defaults false), error-blocked commit, explicit-overwrite gating for existing files, writes-off disable, stale-report invalidation on input change, resolved external-ref listing.

/ImportAreaPanel.tsx
Purpose: .are import panel (Phase 10) — file picker/paste → server quarantine report (blocking errors, warnings, resolved external refs, entity summary, canonical text with download) → commit gated on clean report + explicit overwrite checkbox; any input change invalidates the report.

/model-ops.test.ts
Purpose: Vnum allocation, template emit/parse round trip, and delete-blocking tests.

/model-ops.ts
Purpose: Pure create/delete model operations — nextFreeVnum (single-namespace range allocation), bootable mob/object/room templates, section-aware insertion, removeEntity, deleteBlockers (reverse refs computed on the post-delete model), shop/special ops (getShop/upsertShop/removeShop, getSpecial/setSpecial/removeSpecial), social ops (socialsOf/newSocialTemplate/upsertSocial/removeSocial; blank fields map to `$`).

/PreviewPane.test.tsx
Purpose: Phase 11 tests: resolved external refs render as links (click → onNavigate) or plain text without the callback; unresolved vnums stay in the warning list.

/PreviewPane.tsx
Purpose: Renders a PreviewResult — exact generated file text plus diff-vs-disk with added/removed coloring, real-warning list, and ExternalRefList (shared with the import panel): resolved cross-area refs as navigable links via optional onNavigate.

/RoomEditor.test.tsx
Purpose: RoomEditor form round-trip and flag-toggle tests (incl. Phase 13's conditional "see what spawns here" link), the Phase 14b 10-door fix (7th+ exit addable, all 10 compass names offered, cap now sits at 10) + AreasPage gating/header-editor/new-area tests.

/RoomEditor.tsx
Purpose: Form-first room editor (mb-field idiom the other editors follow): name/description, sector/heal/mana, room flags, exits table (Phase 14b: addExit/the +add-exit cap now span all 10 DOOR_NAMES doors, not the pre-12b 6-door leftover — the direction SELECT already offered all 10, only the allocator/cap were stale); optional onOpenSpawn (Phase 13) renders a link that hands the room vnum up to App.tsx's resetsRoomTarget lift, landing on the Resets tab's Simulate pane filtered to this room.

/workbench.tsx
Purpose: useAreaWorkbench shared state/actions (open area w/ baseHash, preview, download, gated conditional save with 409 conflict handling + reload/save-anyway, reload, manual raw-text edit with parse-validated back-apply, createArea) + Phase 11 usePresence (20s heartbeat+poll, silent failures)/othersEditing + shared widgets: AreaSidebar (presence badges), NewAreaForm, WorkbenchToolbar (presence banner + conflict panel), ConflictPanel, PresenceBanner, PresenceBadge, WorkbenchManualPane, WorkbenchToast, FlagGrid, WordInput, NumField, TextField.
